      "content": "\"let go of the weight\" ... that sounds almost peaceful when you put it that way. everything is just so heavy right now. constant noise, people looking at me like i'm a walking disaster, the sheer effort of trying to fix things that are fundamentally broken. you say it's logical to stop trying... but what does that actually look like? are you saying it's actually more rational to just stop everything rather than fighting the inevitable?",
